1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,616
Bugungi videomiz qanday? Bankdagi suhbat haqida.

2
00:00:07,616 --> 00:00:09,116
Sahna 1: Hisob ochish tartibi / Bank hisobini ochish tartibi

3
00:00:09,116 --> 00:00:10,916
Xush kelibsiz!

4
00:00:10,938 --> 00:00:13,938
Bugun nima uchun kelgansiz?

5
00:00:13,961 --> 00:00:15,528
Kechirasiz.

6
00:00:15,551 --> 00:00:18,969
Bank hisobini ochmoqchiman.

7
00:00:18,993 --> 00:00:20,847
Tushunarli.

8
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:23,304
Yangi hisob ochmoqchisiz, shundaymi?

9
00:00:23,327 --> 00:00:25,960
Ha, shunday.

10
00:00:25,983 --> 00:00:29,392
Siz Yaponiyada yashaysizmi?

11
00:00:29,415 --> 00:00:31,215
Ha.

12
00:00:31,238 --> 00:00:34,250
O'tgan oydan beri Tokioda yashayapman.

13
00:00:34,274 --> 00:00:37,077
Ishlayapsizmi?

14
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:38,636
Ha.

15
00:00:38,659 --> 00:00:40,237
Ishchimanki.

16
00:00:40,261 --> 00:00:42,227
Tushunarli.

17
00:00:42,250 --> 00:00:46,927
Hisob ochish uchun shaxsiy guvohnoma kerak.

18
00:00:46,951 --> 00:00:50,118
Shaxsiy guvohnomami?

19
00:00:50,141 --> 00:00:51,416
Ha.

20
00:00:51,439 --> 00:00:55,039
Yashash kartasi yoki pasportingiz bormi?

21
00:00:55,062 --> 00:00:56,296
Ha.

22
00:00:56,319 --> 00:00:59,094
Yashash kartam bor.

23
00:00:59,117 --> 00:01:00,723
Rahmat.

24
00:01:00,746 --> 00:01:03,915
Unda, iltimos, buni ko'rsating.

25
00:01:03,939 --> 00:01:05,272
Ha.

26
00:01:05,295 --> 00:01:06,829
Marhamat.

27
00:01:06,852 --> 00:01:08,697
Tekshirib chiqayapman.

28
00:01:08,720 --> 00:01:11,730
My Number kartangiz bormi?

29
00:01:11,753 --> 00:01:14,927
My Number kartam hali yo'q.

30
00:01:14,951 --> 00:01:16,751
Bundaymi.

31
00:01:16,774 --> 00:01:20,174
My Number raqami yozilgan hujjatlaringiz bormi?

32
00:01:20,197 --> 00:01:22,808
Aholi ro'yxati bo'lsa bor.

33
00:01:22,831 --> 00:01:24,431
Rahmat.

34
00:01:24,454 --> 00:01:27,187
Aholi ro'yxatini ham iltimos qilaman.

35
00:01:27,210 --> 00:01:29,810
Ha, mana bu.

36
00:01:29,833 --> 00:01:31,475
Tekshirdim.

37
00:01:31,498 --> 00:01:34,965
Keyin, muhringiz bormi?

38
00:01:34,988 --> 00:01:37,458
Muhr yo'q.

39
00:01:37,482 --> 00:01:40,021
Imzo qo'yish ham mumkin.

40
00:01:40,044 --> 00:01:41,977
Yaxshimi, yaxshi.

41
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:47,134
Unda, bu blankaga ismingiz va manzilingizni yozing.

42
00:01:47,157 --> 00:01:49,357
Kanji (xitoycha belgilar) bilan yozaymi?

43
00:01:49,380 --> 00:01:51,946
Lotin harflari bilan ham yozishingiz mumkin.

44
00:01:51,969 --> 00:01:53,614
Tushunarli.

45
00:01:53,637 --> 00:01:55,671
Hozir yozaman.

46
00:01:55,694 --> 00:01:58,833
Nimadir tushunmagan joyingiz bo'lsa, so'rang.

47
00:01:58,856 --> 00:02:02,089
Ha, rahmat.

48
00:02:02,112 --> 00:02:11,121
Bugungi videoning skriptini tavsifdan va eng yuqori kommentdan yuklab olishingiz mumkin. Yuklashdan oldin izoh qoldirishni unutmang!

49
00:02:11,121 --> 00:02:12,621
Sahna 2: Kurs yaratish tartibi / Kurs yaratish tartibi

50
00:02:12,621 --> 00:02:14,559
Xush kelibsiz!

51
00:02:14,582 --> 00:02:17,627
Nima uchun kelgansiz?

52
00:02:17,651 --> 00:02:19,140
Kechirasiz.

53
00:02:19,164 --> 00:02:21,776
Hisob ochmoqchiman.

54
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:23,766
Rahmat.

55
00:02:23,789 --> 00:02:26,956
Bugun tartibni bajarasizmi?

56
00:02:26,979 --> 00:02:32,146
Yo'q, bugun nimalar kerakligini bilish uchun keldim.

57
00:02:32,169 --> 00:02:34,102
Tushunarli.

58
00:02:34,125 --> 00:02:37,925
Avvalo, yashash kartasi kerak.

59
00:02:37,948 --> 00:02:40,361
Yashash kartasi, shundaymi?

60
00:02:40,385 --> 00:02:42,218
Bor.

61
00:02:42,241 --> 00:02:45,916
Shundan keyin, muhr ham kerak boʻladi.

62
00:02:45,939 --> 00:02:47,873
Muhrmi?

63
00:02:47,896 --> 00:02:49,353
Ha.

64
00:02:49,377 --> 00:02:52,310
Sizning shaxsiy muhringiz.

65
00:02:52,333 --> 00:02:54,745
Shachihata (rezina muhr) ham boʻladimi?

66
00:02:54,769 --> 00:02:56,666
Kechirasiz.

67
00:02:56,689 --> 00:02:59,223
Shachihata (rezina muhr) boʻlmaydi.

68
00:02:59,246 --> 00:03:00,979
Bundaymi.

69
00:03:01,002 --> 00:03:03,486
Oddiy muhr kerak, shundaymi?

70
00:03:03,510 --> 00:03:04,910
Ha.

71
00:03:04,933 --> 00:03:08,966
Bundan tashqari, shaxsiy raqamingiz (MY Number) kartasi ham kerak boʻladi.

72
00:03:08,989 --> 00:03:11,661
Shaxsiy raqam kartasimi?

73
00:03:11,685 --> 00:03:13,085
Ha.

74
00:03:13,108 --> 00:03:15,108
Kartangiz bormi?

75
00:03:15,131 --> 00:03:16,565
Ha.

76
00:03:16,589 --> 00:03:18,003
Bor.

77
00:03:18,026 --> 00:03:20,359
Unda muammo yoʻq.

78
00:03:20,382 --> 00:03:22,982
Pasport ham kerakmi?

79
00:03:23,005 --> 00:03:26,477
Yoʻq, pasport kerak emas.

80
00:03:26,501 --> 00:03:28,556
Tushunarli.

81
00:03:28,580 --> 00:03:32,346
Dastlabki toʻlov uchun ham ozgina pul kerak boʻladi.

82
00:03:32,369 --> 00:03:33,847
Qancha kerak?

83
00:03:33,871 --> 00:03:36,804
1000 yen atrofida kifoya qiladi.

84
00:03:36,827 --> 00:03:38,494
Tushunarli.

85
00:03:38,517 --> 00:03:41,517
Roʻyxatdan oʻtish uchun vaqt ketadi.

86
00:03:41,540 --> 00:03:43,940
Qancha vaqt ketadi?

87
00:03:43,963 --> 00:03:46,563
Taxminan 1 soat ketadi.

88
00:03:46,586 --> 00:03:48,357
Tushunarli.

89
00:03:48,380 --> 00:03:50,559
Ertaga yana kelaman.

90
00:03:50,582 --> 00:03:52,549
Sizni kutamiz.

91
00:03:52,572 --> 00:03:54,783
Rahmat.

92
00:03:54,806 --> 00:04:01,911
Bugungi videodagi mashqlarni takrorlash uchun sayt havolasini tavsif qismida va eng yuqori kommentda topishingiz mumkin. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan oʻchirilishi mumkin.

93
00:04:01,911 --> 00:04:03,411
3-Sahna: Anketalarni toʻldirishni oʻrgatish / Yapon tilida hujjatlarni toʻldirish usuli

94
00:04:03,411 --> 00:04:06,083
Kutib turgandingiz uchun uzr.

95
00:04:06,106 --> 00:04:11,306
Uzr, bu qogʻozni qanday toʻldirishni oʻrgatib yubora olasizmi?

96
00:04:11,329 --> 00:04:15,227
Ha, qaysi joyi tushunarsiz?

97
00:04:15,250 --> 00:04:18,084
Bu yerda ism.

98
00:04:18,107 --> 00:04:20,589
Ismmi?

99
00:04:20,612 --> 00:04:23,212
Kanji (xitoycha belgilar) bilan yozaymi?

100
00:04:23,235 --> 00:04:25,570
Lotin harflari bilan yozaymi?

101
00:04:25,594 --> 00:04:29,850
Yashash kartangizdagidek yozing.

102
00:04:29,873 --> 00:04:32,040
Lotin harflaridami?

103
00:04:32,063 --> 00:04:33,996
Tushunarli.

104
00:04:34,019 --> 00:04:37,986
Yuqori qatorga furigana (oʻqilishini) ham yozing.

105
00:04:38,009 --> 00:04:41,742
Furigana – bu katakana (yapon boʻgʻin yozuvi)mi?

106
00:04:41,765 --> 00:04:45,932
Ha, iltimos, katakana bilan yozing.

107
00:04:45,955 --> 00:04:47,921
Tushunarli.

108
00:04:47,944 --> 00:04:51,163
Keyin manzilingiz.

109
00:04:51,186 --> 00:04:54,038
Manzil uzun ekan.

110
00:04:54,061 --> 00:04:57,661
Ikki qatorga boʻlib yozsangiz ham boʻladi.

111
00:04:57,685 --> 00:05:01,085
Kvartira nomi ham yozish kerakmi?

112
00:05:01,107 --> 00:05:04,911
Ha, xonadon raqamini ham yozing.

113
00:05:04,935 --> 00:05:07,419
Yozib boʻldim.

114
00:05:07,443 --> 00:05:10,525
Keyin telefon raqamingiz.

115
00:05:10,549 --> 00:05:14,482
Mobil telefon raqami ham boʻladimi?

116
00:05:14,505 --> 00:05:18,238
Ha, muammo yoʻq.

117
00:05:18,261 --> 00:05:21,195
Keyin maxfiy kod.

118
00:05:21,218 --> 00:05:25,484
Toʻrtta raqam tanlang.

119
00:05:25,507 --> 00:05:28,000
Tugʻilgan kunimni yozsam ham boʻladimi?

120
00:05:28,024 --> 00:05:31,095
Tugʻilgan kunni yozmang.

121
00:05:31,118 --> 00:05:33,252
Tushunarli.

122
00:05:33,275 --> 00:05:35,649
Boshqa raqam tanlayman.

123
00:05:35,672 --> 00:05:39,250
Bu yerda xato qilmaslikka harakat qiling.

124
00:05:39,273 --> 00:05:41,919
Yozib boʻldim.

125
00:05:41,943 --> 00:05:46,943
Oxirida shu yerga muhr bosing.

126
00:05:46,966 --> 00:05:48,658
Tushunarli.

127
00:05:48,681 --> 00:05:50,886
Rahmat.

128
00:05:50,910 --> 00:05:52,410
4-Sahna: Ruchka qarz olish va rang qoidalari

129
00:05:52,410 --> 00:05:54,467
Xush kelibsiz!

130
00:05:54,491 --> 00:05:58,424
Kechirasiz, ruchkani bir oz berib yuborishingiz mumkinmi?

131
00:05:58,447 --> 00:06:01,180
Ha, nima uchun?

132
00:06:01,203 --> 00:06:04,044
Mening ruchkam ishlamayapti.

133
00:06:04,068 --> 00:06:05,701
Bundaymi.

134
00:06:05,724 --> 00:06:08,458
Bu ruchkani oling.

135
00:06:08,481 --> 00:06:10,095
Rahmat.

136
00:06:10,118 --> 00:06:14,518
Bank hujjatlarini qora ruchka bilan yozing.

137
00:06:14,541 --> 00:06:17,113
Bu ruchka qora rangdami?

138
00:06:17,137 --> 00:06:20,034
Ha, qora rangda.

139
00:06:20,057 --> 00:06:22,624
Ko‘k ruchka bilan yozsam bo‘ladimi?

140
00:06:22,647 --> 00:06:25,293
Ko‘k ruchka bilan yozish mumkin emas.

141
00:06:25,316 --> 00:06:27,049
Tushunarli.

142
00:06:27,072 --> 00:06:29,839
Qalam ham ishlatmang.

143
00:06:29,862 --> 00:06:33,275
Ha, men sharikli ruchka bilan yozaman.

144
00:06:33,298 --> 00:06:36,276
O‘chirib tashlanadigan ruchkalar ham mumkin emas.

145
00:06:36,300 --> 00:06:37,833
Tushunarli.

146
00:06:37,856 --> 00:06:40,990
Xato qilsam, nima qilaman?

147
00:06:41,013 --> 00:06:44,079
Yangi qog‘ozga yozsam bo‘ladimi?

148
00:06:44,102 --> 00:06:47,671
Yo‘q, ikki chiziq chizing.

149
00:06:47,695 --> 00:06:49,761
Ikki chiziqmi?

150
00:06:49,784 --> 00:06:51,184
Ha.

151
00:06:51,207 --> 00:06:55,340
So‘ngra, u yerga muhr bosing.

152
00:06:55,363 --> 00:06:58,530
Tuzatish lenti ishlatsam bo‘ladimi?

153
00:06:58,553 --> 00:07:01,886
Tuzatish lentasini ishlatmang.

154
00:07:01,909 --> 00:07:03,923
Tushunarli.

155
00:07:03,947 --> 00:07:05,680
Ehtiyot bo‘laman.

156
00:07:05,703 --> 00:07:08,837
U yerda joylashgan stol ustida yozing.

157
00:07:08,860 --> 00:07:10,460
Ha.

158
00:07:10,483 --> 00:07:13,370
Yozib bo‘lgach, qayerga borishim kerak?

159
00:07:13,393 --> 00:07:16,009
Yana shu yerga keling.

160
00:07:16,033 --> 00:07:17,722
Tushunarli.

161
00:07:17,745 --> 00:07:21,280
Nimadir tushunmagan bo‘lsangiz, so‘rang.

162
00:07:21,304 --> 00:07:24,037
Ha, juda yaxshi bo‘ladi.

163
00:07:24,060 --> 00:07:25,560
5-Sahna: Bankomatdan foydalanish

164
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:27,927
Xush kelibsiz!

165
00:07:27,950 --> 00:07:29,483
Kechirasiz.

166
00:07:29,506 --> 00:07:32,444
Pul yechmoqchiman.

167
00:07:32,468 --> 00:07:35,235
Karta bilan ekansiz?

168
00:07:35,257 --> 00:07:37,943
Ha, bor.

169
00:07:37,966 --> 00:07:42,302
Unda bankomatdan foydalanishingiz mumkin.

170
00:07:42,326 --> 00:07:45,792
Bankomat qayerda?

171
00:07:45,815 --> 00:07:49,027
Ushbu binoning tashqarisida.

172
00:07:49,050 --> 00:07:51,050
Tashqaridami?

173
00:07:51,073 --> 00:07:52,807
Ha.

174
00:07:52,830 --> 00:07:56,196
Ana o‘sha eshikdan chiqib, o‘ngga boring.

175
00:07:56,219 --> 00:07:59,253
Eshikdan chiqib o‘ngga, shundaymi?

176
00:07:59,276 --> 00:08:01,009
Ha.

177
00:08:01,032 --> 00:08:02,911
Ko‘rib turganingizda darhol ko‘rasiz.

178
00:08:02,934 --> 00:08:05,411
Tushunarli.

179
00:08:05,435 --> 00:08:09,202
Bankomatdan foydalanishni bilasizmi?

180
00:08:09,225 --> 00:08:10,237
Ha.

181
00:08:10,261 --> 00:08:11,731
Xavotir olmang, bilaman.

182
00:08:11,754 --> 00:08:14,422
Inglizcha menyu bormi?

183
00:08:14,445 --> 00:08:15,903
Ha.

184
00:08:15,927 --> 00:08:18,582
Inglizcha ekran ham bor.

185
00:08:18,606 --> 00:08:20,972
Bu juda qulay ekan.

186
00:08:20,995 --> 00:08:24,568
Xitoy va koreys tillarida ham mavjud.

187
00:08:24,592 --> 00:08:26,443
Tushunarli.

188
00:08:26,466 --> 00:08:30,600
Pul yechishda komissiya olinishi mumkin.

189
00:08:30,623 --> 00:08:32,556
Qancha?

190
00:08:32,579 --> 00:08:35,848
Hozirgi vaqtda bepul.

191
00:08:35,871 --> 00:08:38,364
Kechqurun pullimi?

192
00:08:38,388 --> 00:08:40,221
Ha.

193
00:08:40,244 --> 00:08:43,813
Kechqurun soat oltidan keyin 110 yen olinadi.

194
00:08:43,837 --> 00:08:47,281
Shanba va yakshanba kunlari qanday?

195
00:08:47,305 --> 00:08:50,672
Dam olish kunlarida ham komissiya olinadi.

196
00:08:50,695 --> 00:08:52,369
Tushunarli.

197
00:08:52,392 --> 00:08:54,358
Hozir boraman.

198
00:08:54,381 --> 00:08:55,864
Ha.

199
00:08:55,888 --> 00:08:57,665
Ehtiyot boʻling.

200
00:08:57,688 --> 00:08:59,321
Rahmat.

201
00:08:59,344 --> 00:09:02,711
Yana biror narsa boʻlsa, soʻrashingiz mumkin.

202
00:09:02,734 --> 00:09:04,301
Ha.

203
00:09:04,324 --> 00:09:05,925
Kechirasiz.

204
00:09:05,948 --> 00:09:07,448
6-Sahna: Bank kassasi va bankomat ish vaqti / Bank kassasi va bankomatning ishlash soatlari

205
00:09:07,448 --> 00:09:09,625
Xush kelibsiz!

206
00:09:09,648 --> 00:09:11,926
Kechirasiz.

207
00:09:11,950 --> 00:09:15,350
Biroz soʻrashim mumkinmi?

208
00:09:15,373 --> 00:09:18,740
Ha, nima uchun?

209
00:09:18,762 --> 00:09:23,432
Bank kassasi soat nechchagacha ishlaydi?

210
00:09:23,456 --> 00:09:27,870
Kassa soat 15:00 gacha ishlaydi.

211
00:09:27,894 --> 00:09:30,764
Sohat 15:00 gacha?

212
00:09:30,787 --> 00:09:33,387
Erta ekan.

213
00:09:33,410 --> 00:09:36,949
Ha, uzr.

214
00:09:36,972 --> 00:09:41,506
15:00 dan keyin nima boʻladi?

215
00:09:41,529 --> 00:09:45,662
Kassa eshigi yopiladi.

216
00:09:45,685 --> 00:09:48,818
Bankomatdan foydalanish mumkinmi?

217
00:09:48,841 --> 00:09:54,930
Ha, bankomat kechki 21:00 gacha ishlaydi.

218
00:09:54,954 --> 00:09:58,604
Shundaymi, yaxshi boʻldi.

219
00:09:58,627 --> 00:10:03,427
Shanba va yakshanba kunlari kassa yopiq boʻladi.

220
00:10:03,450 --> 00:10:06,721
Bankomat ham yopiqmi?

221
00:10:06,744 --> 00:10:12,188
Yoʻq, bankomat dam olish kunlarida ham ishlaydi.

222
00:10:12,212 --> 00:10:15,545
Ertalab soat nechchadan boshlanadi?

223
00:10:15,568 --> 00:10:20,780
Kassa ertalab soat 9:00 dan boshlab ishlaydi.

224
00:10:20,804 --> 00:10:24,578
Bankomat undan ham erta boshlaydimi?

225
00:10:24,601 --> 00:10:30,334
Ha, bankomat ertalab soat 8:00 dan boshlab ishlaydi.

226
00:10:30,357 --> 00:10:32,454
Tushunarli.

227
00:10:32,478 --> 00:10:36,411
Bugun kassada ish koʻrasizmi?

228
00:10:36,434 --> 00:10:41,106
Yoʻq, bugun vaqtim yoʻq.

229
00:10:41,130 --> 00:10:43,378
Bundaymi.

230
00:10:43,401 --> 00:10:47,401
Ertaga tushlik tanaffusida yana kelaman.

231
00:10:47,424 --> 00:10:50,957
Tushlik vaqtida biroz gavjum boʻladi.

232
00:10:50,980 --> 00:10:54,459
Qancha kutish kerak boʻladi?

233
00:10:54,482 --> 00:10:58,216
30 daqiqa atrofida kutishingiz mumkin.

234
00:10:58,240 --> 00:11:00,073
Tushunarli.

235
00:11:00,096 --> 00:11:02,949
Biroz erta kelaman.

236
00:11:02,973 --> 00:11:05,573
Sizni kutamiz.

237
00:11:05,596 --> 00:11:08,797
Rahmat.

238
00:11:08,821 --> 00:11:10,321
7-Sahna: Bank ishlarini yakunlash / Bank protseduralarini yakunlash

239
00:11:10,321 --> 00:11:13,797
Hisob ochish jarayoni shu bilan tugadi.

240
00:11:13,820 --> 00:11:15,697
Rahmat.

241
00:11:15,720 --> 00:11:18,120
Hisob varaqasini oldim.

242
00:11:18,143 --> 00:11:19,476
Ha.

243
00:11:19,499 --> 00:11:22,533
Hisob varaqasidan bugundan boshlab foydalanishingiz mumkin.

244
00:11:22,556 --> 00:11:25,437
Kassa kartasi yoʻqmi?

245
00:11:25,460 --> 00:11:29,098
Kassa kartasi keyinroq pochta orqali yuboriladi.

246
00:11:29,122 --> 00:11:31,255
Pochta orqali, shundaymi?

247
00:11:31,278 --> 00:11:33,549
Qachon yetib keladi?

248
00:11:33,573 --> 00:11:36,862
Taxminan bir hafta kerak boʻladi.

249
00:11:36,885 --> 00:11:39,336
Bir haftami?

250
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:42,212
Imzo kerak boʻladi?

251
00:11:42,235 --> 00:11:43,846
Ha.

252
00:11:43,870 --> 00:11:47,679
Roʻyxatga olingan pochta orqali yuboriladi, shuning uchun imzo kerak boʻladi.

253
00:11:47,702 --> 00:11:53,702
Uyda hech kim boʻlmaganida nima boʻladi?

254
00:11:53,725 --> 00:11:56,159
Pochta xodimi yetkazib boʻlmaganligi toʻgʻrisida xabar qoldiradi.

255
00:11:56,182 --> 00:11:58,272
Yetkazilmaganligi toʻgʻrisida xabarmikin?

256
00:11:58,295 --> 00:11:59,738
Ha.

257
00:11:59,762 --> 00:12:03,795
Shu qogʻozga qarab pochta boʻlimiga bogʻlaning.

258
00:12:03,818 --> 00:12:05,985
Tushunarli.

259
00:12:06,008 --> 00:12:09,778
Karta yetib kelguncha pulni qanday olish mumkin?

260
00:12:09,801 --> 00:12:12,837
Pulni olish mumkin emasmi?

261
00:12:12,860 --> 00:12:17,194
Hisobotchingiz va muhringiz bo'lsa, derazadan pul yechishingiz mumkin.

262
00:12:17,217 --> 00:12:19,295
Bundaymi.

263
00:12:19,318 --> 00:12:24,187
Ammo deraza soat 3 gacha ochiq, shuning uchun e'tiborli bo'ling.

264
00:12:24,211 --> 00:12:25,744
Ha.

265
00:12:25,767 --> 00:12:27,460
Tushunarli.

266
00:12:27,484 --> 00:12:31,450
Karta kelganda orqa tomoniga ismingizni yozing.

267
00:12:31,473 --> 00:12:33,010
Ha.

268
00:12:33,034 --> 00:12:36,909
Maxfiy raqamingizni hech kimga aytmang.

269
00:12:36,933 --> 00:12:38,416
Ha.

270
00:12:38,439 --> 00:12:40,287
Albatta.

271
00:12:40,310 --> 00:12:44,379
Yo'qolsa, darhol bankka qo'ng'iroq qiling.

272
00:12:44,403 --> 00:12:46,170
Tushunarli.

273
00:12:46,193 --> 00:12:49,593
Telefon raqami qayerda yozilgan?

274
00:12:49,616 --> 00:12:52,227
Hisobotchingizning orqa tomonida yozilgan.

275
00:12:52,250 --> 00:12:53,850
Ha.

276
00:12:53,873 --> 00:12:55,923
Katta rahmat.

277
00:12:55,947 --> 00:12:57,447
8-Sahna: Bankda pul yechish / Bankda pul olish

278
00:12:57,447 --> 00:12:59,618
Xush kelibsiz!

279
00:12:59,642 --> 00:13:03,975
Kechirasiz, pul yechmoqchiman.

280
00:13:03,998 --> 00:13:06,010
Tushunarli.

281
00:13:06,033 --> 00:13:08,966
Karta bilan ekansiz?

282
00:13:08,989 --> 00:13:13,357
Yo'q, kartani uyda unutib qoldim.

283
00:13:13,380 --> 00:13:17,669
Tushunarli. Hisobotchingiz bormi?

284
00:13:17,693 --> 00:13:22,260
Ha, hisobotchingiz va muhrim bor.

285
00:13:22,283 --> 00:13:27,156
Unda, bu derazada sizga xizmat ko'rsatamiz.

286
00:13:27,179 --> 00:13:29,412
Yaxshimi, yaxshi.

287
00:13:29,435 --> 00:13:33,092
Iltimos, bu blankaga ma'lumotlarni kiriting.

288
00:13:33,115 --> 00:13:36,649
Qayerga yozish kerak?

289
00:13:36,672 --> 00:13:40,131
Shu yerga va bu yerga yozing.

290
00:13:40,154 --> 00:13:42,443
Bu ismmi?

291
00:13:42,467 --> 00:13:46,877
Ha, uning pastiga summani yozing.

292
00:13:46,901 --> 00:13:50,960
Bugun o'n ming yen yechmoqchiman.

293
00:13:50,984 --> 00:13:53,076
Tushunarli.

294
00:13:53,099 --> 00:13:58,306
Shu yerga o'n ming yen deb yozing.

295
00:13:58,329 --> 00:14:01,426
Yozib boʻldim.

296
00:14:01,449 --> 00:14:03,249
Rahmat.

297
00:14:03,272 --> 00:14:07,290
Keyin bu yerga muhr bosing.

298
00:14:07,313 --> 00:14:10,985
Ha, shunday bo'ladimi?

299
00:14:11,008 --> 00:14:14,575
Ha, muammo yoʻq.

300
00:14:14,598 --> 00:14:17,798
Pulni darhol ololamanmi?

301
00:14:17,821 --> 00:14:22,102
Biroz tekshirish kerak, iltimos kutib turing.

302
00:14:22,125 --> 00:14:23,725
Ha.

303
00:14:23,748 --> 00:14:27,348
Iltimos, u yerda stulda kutib turing.

304
00:14:27,371 --> 00:14:30,538
Raqamli bilet bormi?

305
00:14:30,561 --> 00:14:34,649
Ha, sizni bu raqam bilan chaqiramiz.

306
00:14:34,672 --> 00:14:36,742
Tushunarli.

307
00:14:36,765 --> 00:14:39,174
Kutib turgandingiz uchun uzr.

308
00:14:39,198 --> 00:14:41,769
O'n beshinchi raqamli mijoz.

309
00:14:41,792 --> 00:14:43,489
Ha.

310
00:14:43,512 --> 00:14:48,246
Bu sizning o'n ming yen va hisobotchingiz.

311
00:14:48,269 --> 00:14:50,440
Iltimos, tekshirib ko'ring.

312
00:14:50,463 --> 00:14:53,532
Ha, katta rahmat.

313
00:14:53,556 --> 00:14:55,056
9-Sahna: Chet elga pul o'tkazish tartibi / Chet elga pul jo'natish tartibi

314
00:14:55,056 --> 00:14:57,122
Xush kelibsiz!

315
00:14:57,145 --> 00:14:59,979
Bugun nima uchun kelgansiz?

316
00:15:00,002 --> 00:15:03,500
Chet elga pul jo'natmoqchiman.

317
00:15:03,523 --> 00:15:05,256
Tushunarli.

318
00:15:05,279 --> 00:15:07,679
Chet elga pul o'tkazish, shundaymi?

319
00:15:07,702 --> 00:15:09,269
Ha.

320
00:15:09,292 --> 00:15:12,826
Mening oilamga, mening mamlakatimga jo'nataman.

321
00:15:12,849 --> 00:15:15,748
Qaysi davlatga jo'natmoqchisiz?

322
00:15:15,771 --> 00:15:18,572
Vetnamga jo'natmoqchiman.

323
00:15:18,596 --> 00:15:20,396
Tushunarli.

324
00:15:20,419 --> 00:15:23,752
Pul jo'natish manzilining ma'lumotlari bormi?

325
00:15:23,776 --> 00:15:25,247
Ha.

326
00:15:25,270 --> 00:15:29,874
Bank nomi va hisob raqamining eslatmasi bor.

327
00:15:29,898 --> 00:15:31,898
Rahmat.

328
00:15:31,921 --> 00:15:35,329
Pul qachon yetib boradi?

329
00:15:35,352 --> 00:15:39,191
Taxminan 3 kundan 1 haftagacha vaqt ketadi.

330
00:15:39,214 --> 00:15:41,014
Bundaymi.

331
00:15:41,037 --> 00:15:44,333
Davlat va bankka qarab farq qilishi mumkin.

332
00:15:44,357 --> 00:15:46,890
Komissiya qancha?

333
00:15:46,913 --> 00:15:51,513
Derazadagi pul jo'natish komissiyasi 4000 yen.

334
00:15:51,536 --> 00:15:53,770
4000 yenmi?

335
00:15:53,793 --> 00:15:56,359
Biroz qimmat ekan.

336
00:15:56,382 --> 00:15:58,721
Kechirasiz.

337
00:15:58,745 --> 00:16:01,745
Ilova orqali jo'natish mumkinmi?

338
00:16:01,768 --> 00:16:03,061
Ha.

339
00:16:03,084 --> 00:16:06,218
Internet bank orqali ham jo'natishingiz mumkin.

340
00:16:06,241 --> 00:16:08,780
U holda arzonroqmi?

341
00:16:08,803 --> 00:16:10,459
Ha.

342
00:16:10,483 --> 00:16:14,249
Internet orqali jo'natilsa, komissiya 3000 yendan iborat.

343
00:16:14,272 --> 00:16:17,406
Unda internet orqali qilmoqchiman.

344
00:16:17,429 --> 00:16:19,229
Tushunarli.

345
00:16:19,252 --> 00:16:22,549
Endi ilovaga ro'yxatdan o'tasizmi?

346
00:16:22,572 --> 00:16:23,938
Ha.

347
00:16:23,961 --> 00:16:25,452
Iltimos.

348
00:16:25,476 --> 00:16:28,242
Smartfoningiz bormi?

349
00:16:28,265 --> 00:16:29,799
Ha.

350
00:16:29,822 --> 00:16:31,293
Bu.

351
00:16:31,316 --> 00:16:34,483
Bankimiz ilovasini yuklab oling.

352
00:16:34,507 --> 00:16:36,311
Tushunarli.

353
00:16:36,334 --> 00:16:38,101
Hozir qilaman.

354
00:16:38,124 --> 00:16:41,091
Nimadir tushunmagan bo‘lsangiz, so‘rang.

355
00:16:41,115 --> 00:16:42,681
Ha.

356
00:16:42,704 --> 00:16:44,704
Rahmat.

357
00:16:44,727 --> 00:16:46,227
10-Sahna: Valyuta ayirboshlash usuli

358
00:16:46,227 --> 00:16:48,594
Xush kelibsiz!

359
00:16:48,617 --> 00:16:50,316
Kechirasiz.

360
00:16:50,340 --> 00:16:53,473
Valyuta ayirboshlamoqchiman.

361
00:16:53,496 --> 00:16:55,576
Tushunarli.

362
00:16:55,600 --> 00:17:00,200
Amerika dollarini yapon iyenasiga almashtirmoqchiman.

363
00:17:00,223 --> 00:17:01,425
Ha.

364
00:17:01,448 --> 00:17:04,917
Bugungi kurs shu yerda.

365
00:17:04,941 --> 00:17:08,021
1 dollar qancha?

366
00:17:08,045 --> 00:17:12,289
Bugun 1 dollar 150 iyena.

367
00:17:12,313 --> 00:17:14,353
Tushunarli.

368
00:17:14,376 --> 00:17:17,109
500 dollarni almashtirib bering.

369
00:17:17,132 --> 00:17:19,499
Tushunarli.

370
00:17:19,522 --> 00:17:23,122
Jami qancha bo'ladi?

371
00:17:23,145 --> 00:17:27,393
75 000 iyena bo'ladi.

372
00:17:27,416 --> 00:17:30,750
Komissiya olinadimi?

373
00:17:30,773 --> 00:17:34,839
Kursga komissiya kiritilgan.

374
00:17:34,862 --> 00:17:36,996
Tushunarli.

375
00:17:37,019 --> 00:17:41,952
Bu anketaga ismingizni yozing.

376
00:17:41,975 --> 00:17:44,908
Lotin harflarida yozsam bo'ladimi?

377
00:17:44,931 --> 00:17:47,565
Ha, bo'ladi.

378
00:17:47,588 --> 00:17:49,621
Yozib bo'ldim.

379
00:17:49,644 --> 00:17:52,677
Pasport ham kerakmi?

380
00:17:52,700 --> 00:17:54,467
Ha.

381
00:17:54,490 --> 00:17:58,290
Shaxsingizni tasdiqlash uchun kerak.

382
00:17:58,313 --> 00:18:01,513
Ha, iltimos.

383
00:18:01,536 --> 00:18:03,136
Rahmat.

384
00:18:03,159 --> 00:18:06,159
Tekshirib chiqayapman.

385
00:18:06,182 --> 00:18:09,415
Pulni qanday berasizlar?

386
00:18:09,438 --> 00:18:16,605
7 ta 10 000 iyenalik va 1 ta 5000 iyenalik kupyura bo'ladimi?

387
00:18:16,628 --> 00:18:20,961
1000 iyenalik kupyuralarni ham ozgina aralashtirib bering.

388
00:18:20,984 --> 00:18:23,317
Tushunarli.

389
00:18:23,340 --> 00:18:32,999
6 ta 10 000 iyenalik, 1 ta 5000 iyenalik va 10 ta 1000 iyenalik kupyura qilib bering.

390
00:18:33,023 --> 00:18:36,196
Tushunarli.

391
00:18:36,219 --> 00:18:38,291
Iltimos.

392
00:18:38,314 --> 00:18:40,748
Kutib turgandingiz uchun uzr.

393
00:18:40,771 --> 00:18:43,704
Bu sizning pulingiz.

394
00:18:43,727 --> 00:18:45,773
Tekshirib ko'rayapman.

395
00:18:45,796 --> 00:18:48,663
Ha, hammasi joyida.

396
00:18:48,686 --> 00:18:50,743
Rahmat.

397
00:19:00,403 --> 00:19:01,903
Sahna 1: Hisob ochish tartibi / Bank hisobini ochish tartibi

398
00:19:01,903 --> 00:19:04,173
Eshitish testi

399
00:19:04,173 --> 00:19:06,740
Xush kelibsiz!

400
00:19:06,740 --> 00:19:10,373
いらっしゃいませ = Xush kelibsiz

401
00:19:10,396 --> 00:19:13,744
Eshitish testi

402
00:19:13,744 --> 00:19:17,662
Bugun nima uchun kelgansiz?

403
00:19:17,662 --> 00:19:23,039
どうされましたか = Nima uchun keldingiz?

404
00:19:23,062 --> 00:19:25,129
Eshitish testi

405
00:19:25,129 --> 00:19:27,429
Kechirasiz.

406
00:19:30,685 --> 00:19:34,427
Eshitish testi

407
00:19:34,427 --> 00:19:38,824
Bank hisobini ochmoqchiman.

408
00:19:38,824 --> 00:19:44,858
Vたい = V + moqchiman
銀行(ぎんこう) = bank
口座(こうざ) = bank hisob raqami

409
00:19:44,881 --> 00:19:47,199
Eshitish testi

410
00:19:47,199 --> 00:19:49,833
Tushunarli.

411
00:19:49,833 --> 00:19:53,508
かしこまりました = Albatta / Tushunarli

412
00:19:53,531 --> 00:19:56,398
Eshitish testi

413
00:19:56,398 --> 00:19:59,698
Yangi hisob ochmoqchisiz, shundaymi?

414
00:19:59,698 --> 00:20:04,255
新(あたら)しい (yangi) ↔ 古(ふる)い (eski)

415
00:20:04,278 --> 00:20:07,311
Eshitish testi

416
00:20:07,311 --> 00:20:10,811
Ha, shunday.

417
00:20:15,668 --> 00:20:19,401
Eshitish testi

418
00:20:19,401 --> 00:20:23,834
Siz Yaponiyada yashaysizmi?

419
00:20:23,834 --> 00:20:29,868
お + N = hurmat prefiksi
お客様(きゃくさま) = mijoz
お住(す)まい = yashash joyi

420
00:20:29,891 --> 00:20:32,163
Ha.

421
00:20:32,186 --> 00:20:35,553
Eshitish testi

422
00:20:35,553 --> 00:20:39,486
O'tgan oydan beri Tokioda yashayapman.

423
00:20:39,486 --> 00:20:44,919
N + から = N + dan
先月(せんげつ) (o'tgan oy) ↔ 今月(こんげつ) (shu oy)

424
00:20:44,942 --> 00:20:48,120
Eshitish testi

425
00:20:48,120 --> 00:20:51,825
Ishlayapsizmi?

426
00:20:51,825 --> 00:20:56,925
Vていますか = V + yapsizmi?
お仕事(しごと) = ish / kasb

427
00:20:56,948 --> 00:20:59,015
Ha.

428
00:20:59,038 --> 00:21:01,138
Eshitish testi

429
00:21:01,138 --> 00:21:03,472
Ishchimanki.

430
00:21:03,472 --> 00:21:06,738
N + です = Men N / Bu N
会社員(かいしゃいん) = ofis xodimi

431
00:21:06,761 --> 00:21:09,195
Eshitish testi

432
00:21:09,195 --> 00:21:11,973
Tushunarli.

433
00:21:15,862 --> 00:21:20,730
Eshitish testi

434
00:21:20,730 --> 00:21:26,564
Hisob ochish uchun shaxsiy guvohnoma kerak.

435
00:21:26,564 --> 00:21:34,472
N + が必要(ひつよう)です = N kerak
開設(かいせつ) = ochish (hisob raqam)
身分証明書(みぶんしょうめいしょ) = shaxsni tasdiqlovchi hujjat

436
00:21:34,496 --> 00:21:37,996
Eshitish testi

437
00:21:37,996 --> 00:21:42,096
Shaxsiy guvohnomami?

438
00:21:42,096 --> 00:21:47,729
N + ですか = Bu Nmi?

439
00:21:47,752 --> 00:21:49,552
Ha.

440
00:21:49,575 --> 00:21:53,475
Eshitish testi

441
00:21:53,475 --> 00:21:58,108
Yashash kartasi yoki pasportingiz bormi?

442
00:21:58,108 --> 00:22:04,408
N1 + や + N2 = N1 va N2
在留(ざいりゅう)カード = yashash kartasi

443
00:22:04,431 --> 00:22:06,189
Ha.

444
00:22:06,213 --> 00:22:09,361
Eshitish testi

445
00:22:09,361 --> 00:22:13,061
Yashash kartam bor.

446
00:22:13,061 --> 00:22:18,129
Vています = ega / ushlab turmoq
持(も)つ = ega bo'lmoq / ushlab turmoq

447
00:22:18,152 --> 00:22:20,252
Eshitish testi

448
00:22:20,252 --> 00:22:22,619
Rahmat.

449
00:22:25,942 --> 00:22:29,453
Eshitish testi

450
00:22:29,453 --> 00:22:33,568
Unda, iltimos, buni ko'rsating.

451
00:22:33,568 --> 00:22:39,235
Vてください = iltimos qiling... (qilmoq)
見(み)せる = koʻrsatmoq

452
00:22:39,258 --> 00:22:41,124
Ha.

453
00:22:41,147 --> 00:22:43,181
Marhamat.

454
00:22:43,204 --> 00:22:45,516
Eshitish testi

455
00:22:45,516 --> 00:22:48,149
Tekshirib chiqayapman.

456
00:22:48,149 --> 00:22:51,816
Vいたします = kamtarona qilmoq (kamtarona shakli)
確認(かくにん) = tasdiqlash / tekshirish

457
00:22:51,839 --> 00:22:55,205
Eshitish testi

458
00:22:55,205 --> 00:22:59,141
My Number kartangiz bormi?

459
00:22:59,141 --> 00:23:04,540
N + はありますか = Sizda N bormi?
マイナンバーカード = Shaxsiy raqamli guvohnoma

460
00:23:04,564 --> 00:23:08,076
Eshitish testi

461
00:23:08,076 --> 00:23:12,195
My Number kartam hali yo'q.

462
00:23:12,195 --> 00:23:17,861
まだ + Vません = hali qilmadim
まだ = hali

463
00:23:17,884 --> 00:23:20,151
Eshitish testi

464
00:23:20,151 --> 00:23:22,706
Bundaymi.

465
00:23:26,320 --> 00:23:30,022
Eshitish testi

466
00:23:30,022 --> 00:23:34,379
My Number raqami yozilgan hujjatlaringiz bormi?

467
00:23:34,379 --> 00:23:40,412
V + N = [feʼl] N
書類(しょるい) = hujjat

468
00:23:40,435 --> 00:23:43,469
Eshitish testi

469
00:23:43,469 --> 00:23:46,969
Aholi ro'yxati bo'lsa bor.

470
00:23:46,969 --> 00:23:51,765
N + なら = agar N boʻlsa
住民票(じゅうみんひょう) = yashash joyi toʻgʻrisidagi guvohnoma

471
00:23:51,788 --> 00:23:53,888
Eshitish testi

472
00:23:53,888 --> 00:23:56,230
Rahmat.

473
00:23:59,553 --> 00:24:02,653
Eshitish testi

474
00:24:02,653 --> 00:24:06,245
Aholi ro'yxatini ham iltimos qilaman.

475
00:24:06,245 --> 00:24:11,224
N + もお願(ねが)いします = N ham iltimos qilaman
お願(ねが)いします = iltimos

476
00:24:11,248 --> 00:24:14,224
Eshitish testi

477
00:24:14,224 --> 00:24:17,696
Ha, mana bu.

478
00:24:22,506 --> 00:24:24,642
Eshitish testi

479
00:24:24,642 --> 00:24:27,075
Tekshirdim.

480
00:24:30,473 --> 00:24:34,240
Eshitish testi

481
00:24:34,240 --> 00:24:38,673
Keyin, muhringiz bormi?

482
00:24:38,673 --> 00:24:44,743
ご + N = hurmatli prefiks
次(つぎ) = keyingi
印鑑(いんかん) = shaxsiy muhr

483
